WAKE UP SLOW  (10 s; 2 scenes, 3 shots)
synopsis: In a kitchen at dawn, hot brewed coffee steams inside the Plaid Mug on the wooden table during a three-second close hold. Mara's right hand enters, takes the handle, and slowly lifts the mug over the next four seconds while the camera remains still. A cut to a plain cream field reveals the Cabin Coffee Company logo with Wake up slow beneath it for the final three seconds.
theme: Quiet pleasure comes from taking one's time.

